hi everybody i'm josh welsh president of  film independent and welcome to the 2022  film independent spirit awards  nominations announcement we are so  excited to be able to share this year's  slate of nominees with you visionary  storytellers working across film and  television for the past several months  our nominating committees have been hard  at work watching eligible shows and  films from  2021 at the spirit awards we look for  uniqueness of vision original  provocative subject matter economy of  means and diversity both on screen and  off at film independent we champion  creative independence and visual  storytelling and we support a community  of filmmakers and film lovers who share  those values this year of our nominated  writers and directors i'm proud to share  that 44 are women and 38 are bipod and  of our nominating committee members who  worked so hard to reach today's  nominations 63 identify as women 5  percent is non-binary and 56 as bipac  this year we had almost 50 dedicated  filmmakers and film lovers who spent  months watching and fiercely debating  almost 650 films and series a record  number fiction and non-fiction american  and international in order to arrive at  today's nominations i'd like to take a  moment to thank this year's incredible  partners our premier sponsor ifc  our official spirits bullet frontier  whiskey and seedlip and our official  water fiji water we so appreciate your  support and devotion to the independent  community we are so happy the spirit  awards are going to be back in person on  the beach in santa monica once again the  show will be broadcast on ifc  not on the saturday before the oscars  but on sunday march 6th so please tune  in one last note about the spirit awards  for anyone who might be new to this the  winners of the spirit awards are chosen  by film independent members film  independent is an open access  organization that welcomes filmmakers  and film lovers alike no matter who you  are or where you live if you care about  great storytelling we want you as a  member in order to vote this year please  join by december the 21st  you'll get screeners of nominated films  and shows but most importantly you will  become part of the community that votes  to determine the winners of the 2022  film independence spirit awards please  join me in welcoming our three amazing  presenters this morning beanie feldstein  regina hall and naomi watts naomi take  it away  hi everyone and welcome to the spirit  awards one of my favorite award  ceremonies i have many great memories  being there in that room amongst so many  of my peers and feeling so proud to be  there i do remember the 21 grams  audience award most of all and that was  one of the most memorable experiences  for me so getting over to the nominees  in the category of best screen play  come on come  on the lost daughter  swan song  together together  and zola the nominees in the category of  best cinematography are  chiara  blue bayou  the humans  passing  and zola nominees in the category of  best documentary are  ascension  flee  in in the same breath  procession  summer of soul  or when the revolution could not be  televised  the nominees in the category of best  first feature are  seven days  holler  queen of glory  test pattern  wild indian  the nominees in the category of best  supporting male are  coleman domingo  zola  miko gattuso  queen of glory  troy kotzer  will patton  sweet thing  chucksey spencer  wild indian  the nominees in the category of best  male lead are  clifton collins jr  jockey  frankie faison the killing of kenneth  chamberlain  michael grahaes  wild indian  udo kier  swansong  and simon rex  red rocket  the nominees for the john cassavetes  award are  cryptozoo jockey  shiva baby  sweet thing  and this is not a war story  this year's robert altman award which is  given to one film's director casting  director and ensemble cast  mass  director fran krantz  casting directors henry russell  bergstein alison estrin  ensemble cast kagan albright reed bernie  michelle n carter  and dowd  jason isaacs  martha plimpton  breeda wool  regina over to you  thank you so much naomi now the nominee  in the category of best first screenplay  are  cicada  mass  pig  test pattern and wild indian the  nominees in the category of best editing  are  akita  the killing of kenneth chamberlain  the novice  the nowhere in  and zola  the nominees in the category of best  international film are  compartment number six finland  drive my car japan  parallel mothers spain  pebbles  india  petite mama  france  prayers for the stolen mexico the  nominees in the category of best  supporting female are  jesse buckley the lost daughter  amy forsythe the novice  ruth nega passing  ravika and rousselle  pleasure  susannah sun  red rocket  the nominees in the category of best  female lead are  isabel furman the novice  britney s hall test pattern  patty harrison together together  taylor page  zola  kaylee reese  catch the fair one the nominees in the  category of best director are  janiksa bravo zola  maggie gyllenhaal the lost daughter  lauren hattaway the novice  mike mills come on come on  ninja thyberg pleasure the nominees in  the category of best feature are  a chiara  come on come on  the lost  daughter the novice  and zola  now beanie over to you  thank you so much regina let's start  with the emerging filmmaker award  categories each of these awards  recognizes emerging filmmakers who have  not yet received the appropriate  recognition each emerging filmmaker  award comes with an unrestricted grant  of 25 000  the truer than fiction award is  presented to a talented director of  non-fiction features the finalists are  jessica beshear director of faya dei  debi lum director of try harder  angelo madsen minax director of north by  current the someone to watch award  honors a talented filmmaker of singular  vision the finalists are  alex camilleri director of luzu  jillian wallace horvat director of i  blame society  michael cernovsky director of pig the  producers award which is given to an  emerging producer who despite highly  limited resources demonstrates the  creativity tenacity and vision required  to produce quality independent films the  finalists are  brad becker parton pinchon liu  lizzie shapiro  here are the nominees in tv series for  the spirit awards  the nominees in the category of best new  scripted series are  blind spotting  it's a sin  reservation dogs the underground  railroad we are lady parts  the nominees in the category of best new  non-scripted or documentary series are  black and missing the cho show  the lady and the dale  nuclear family  philly d.a  the nominees in the category of best  male performance in a new scripted  series are  ali alexander it's a sin  murray bartlett the white lotus  michael grey eyes rutherford falls  lee jong-jae squid game  ashley thomas them covenant best female  performance in a new scripted series are  deborah irinde them covenant  jasmine cephas jones blind spotting  tusso and baidu the underground railroad  jenna schmeeding rutherford falls  anjana vossen we are lady parts  and finally the best ensemble cast in a  new scripted series is awarded to  reservation dogs ensemble cast paulina  alexis  lane factor funny bone devilry jacobs  zahn mclaren lil mike  sarah podemski and deferra lunatai  congratulations to all the nominees  today and remember only film independent  members vote for the winners of the  spirit awards so to become a member  visit  filmindependent.org and join today and  don't forget tune in on our new date  sunday march 6 back at the beach in  santa monica  thank you beanie and thank you naomi and  regina congratulations again to all of  our nominees and remember please join  film independent and vote for the  winners of the spirit awards in 2022 and  don't forget tune in on our new date and  time sunday march 6 on ifc  thanks for watching and see you on the  beach 